===Etymology===
{{Wiktionary:Picture dictionary/en:head}}
[[File:Human brain NIH.jpg|thumb|A human brain]]

{{root|en|ine-pro|*mregʰ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|brayn}}, {{m|enm|brain}}, from {{inh|en|ang|bræġn|t=brain}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*bragn}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*bragną|t=brain}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*mregʰnom|t=skull, brain}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*mregʰ-|t=marrow, sinciput}} + {{m|ine-pro|*-mn̥|t=nominal suffix}}.

Cognate with {{cog|sco|braine}}, {{m|sco|brane|t=brain}}, {{cog|frr|brayen}}, {{m|frr|brein|t=brain}}, {{cog|stq|Brainge|t=brain}}, {{cog|fy|brein|t=brain}}, {{cog|nl|brein|t=brain}}, {{cog|nds|Brägen|}}, {{m|nds|Bregen|t=brain}} (whence {{cog|de|Bregen|t=animal brain}}), {{cog|grc|βρεχμός|t=front part of the skull, top of the head}}.

